# Advancing the target rewrites every stored stamp to the new target.
MODULE: StoredStampFixedAdvanceRestamps
TARGET: StoredStampFixed
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a target advance re-stamps stored values
PERTURBS: Advance

--- FIND
    /\ tgt' = 2
    /\ UNCHANGED <<kind, body, stamp, strict, hop, st, tag, retried, decided, up, faults, lastRead>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ tgt' = 2
    /\ tag' = [e \in Entries |-> IF st[e] = "Pending" THEN tag[e] ELSE 2]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<kind, body, stamp, strict, hop, st, retried, decided, up, faults, lastRead>>
--- END
